{"2976770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Depths of Despair", "steam_appid": 2976770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">ANGELS X DEMONS  SOULS-LIKE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Depths of Despair</strong> is a dark fantasy action RPG that focuses on adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Combines souls-like combat  with MMO progression and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even though the game has sliding, jumping and many skills, it is still a slower-paced, classic Souls-like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/d4179ea7e2ae97dc56d3135ef0c5c6e0.webp?t=1785779071\" width=679 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME MODES </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOURNEYMAN</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death = respawn at hub area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOFTCORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death = you'll lose all your items and respawn at hub area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARCORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death = Delete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUSTOM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is basically a built in randomizer mod. Choose custom settings from a selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/33e36bb89da11edf85329baaf0358bae.avif?t=1785779071\" width=700 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">IN GAME ACTIVITIES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/d4179ea7e2ae97dc56d3135ef0c5c6e0.webp?t=1785779071\" width=679 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MINING &amp; GATHERING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash rocks and gather herbs throughout the world while traveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SMITHING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ores you collect from mining to upgrade all your gear, gaining experience for it. Upgrading increases the current stats and there is no level cap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENCHANTING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a rare chance to obtain various gems while mining. These gems can be used to enchant your gear with new stats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUTCHER</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect meat from monsters and use the herbs from gathering. These ingredients can be used to prepare meals at the butcher to gain temporary and permanent stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 12 zones, 12 boss battles and 156 different monsters. ~ 300  skills and perks, and you can combine any skill tree with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/d4179ea7e2ae97dc56d3135ef0c5c6e0.webp?t=1785779071\" width=679 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man who has lost everything and stands on the brink of becoming a demon. The only thing keeping you going is the hope of saving your daughter and that same hope is what preserves your humanity.<br><br>Along the way, you encounter an angel who needs your help to find and save her sister. The world around you is grim and unforgiving, steeped in despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTES</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I designed the game to be played with mouse &amp; keyboard and I highly recommend doing so. You can cast spells at mouse location and the UI navigation is much easier.<br>  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">ANGELS X DEMONS  SOULS-LIKE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Depths of Despair</strong> is a dark fantasy action RPG that focuses on adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Combines souls-like combat  with MMO progression and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even though the game has sliding, jumping and many skills, it is still a slower-paced, classic Souls-like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/d4179ea7e2ae97dc56d3135ef0c5c6e0.webp?t=1785779071\" width=679 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME MODES </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOURNEYMAN</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death = respawn at hub area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOFTCORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death = you'll lose all your items and respawn at hub area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARCORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death = Delete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUSTOM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is basically a built in randomizer mod. Choose custom settings from a selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/33e36bb89da11edf85329baaf0358bae.avif?t=1785779071\" width=700 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">IN GAME ACTIVITIES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/d4179ea7e2ae97dc56d3135ef0c5c6e0.webp?t=1785779071\" width=679 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MINING &amp; GATHERING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash rocks and gather herbs throughout the world while traveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SMITHING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ores you collect from mining to upgrade all your gear, gaining experience for it. Upgrading increases the current stats and there is no level cap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENCHANTING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a rare chance to obtain various gems while mining. These gems can be used to enchant your gear with new stats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUTCHER</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect meat from monsters and use the herbs from gathering. These ingredients can be used to prepare meals at the butcher to gain temporary and permanent stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 12 zones, 12 boss battles and 156 different monsters. ~ 300  skills and perks, and you can combine any skill tree with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/extras/d4179ea7e2ae97dc56d3135ef0c5c6e0.webp?t=1785779071\" width=679 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man who has lost everything and stands on the brink of becoming a demon. The only thing keeping you going is the hope of saving your daughter and that same hope is what preserves your humanity.<br><br>Along the way, you encounter an angel who needs your help to find and save her sister. The world around you is grim and unforgiving, steeped in despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTES</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I designed the game to be played with mouse &amp; keyboard and I highly recommend doing so. You can cast spells at mouse location and the UI navigation is much easier.<br>  </p>", "short_description": "Slower-paced souls-like RPG with classic MMO progression, skills and ability bar. The world is grim and unforgiving, steeped in despair. Heavy punishment and consequences are naturally present.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/b4e2cddcef6b97e8a64e6be74cad02139c9ec3a2/header.jpg?t=1785779071", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/308ec6291e49ca8e2892cffbaefa063d3a11432a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785779071", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976770/308ec6291e49ca8e2892cffbaefa063d3a11432a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785779071", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 1060 3 GB or AMD RADEON RX 580 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Both DirectX 11 and 12.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimu